<title>UK: Council of Europe sets NZ$100 mln two-year bond.</title>
<headline>Council of Europe sets NZ$100 mln two-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Tokyo-Mitsubishi International Plc and Tokyo Securities Co (Europe) Ltd.</p>
<p> BORROWER   COUNCIL OF EUROPE</p>
<p> AMT     NZ$100 MLN   COUPON     7.00	MATURITY    25.NOV.98</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    25.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.90	LISTING    NONE	PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA1/AAA   DENOMS (K) 1	   SALE LIMITS US/UK/NZ</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  SUPRA     TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.20	SELL CONC  0.70</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
